{
    "title": "Burner: Second Phone Number",
    "description": "Take Control of Your Phone Number Privacy with \ud83d\udd25Burner \ud83d\udd25\r\n\r\nWelcome to Burner, the ultimate virtual solution for safeguarding your privacy in a connected world. Burner empowers you to protect your personal information, maintain boundaries, and communicate on your terms. \r\n\r\n1\ufe0f\u20e3Sign up for Burner and select an area code to create your private number\r\n2\ufe0f\u20e3Enjoy sending and receiving unlimited SMS messages and calls (all you need is a Wi-Fi connection or mobile data)\r\n3\ufe0f\u20e3Burn your number whenever you want and get a new anonymous line\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd12 Keep Your Real Number Under Wraps\r\n\r\nTired of sharing your personal phone number with everyone but don\u2019t want to get a second SIM card or eSIM just for private communications? Burner lets you create temporary, disposable phone numbers for any occasion.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf10Spam-Free, Private Connections\r\n\r\nSay goodbye to annoying callers and intrusive messages. Our award-winning spam-blocking feature means you can connect confidently without the fear of spam calls and texts.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude43 Simplify Your Busy Life\r\n\r\nBurner provides essential tools, like private SMS text messages, and organizational features, like color-coded inboxes, to effortlessly manage your communications \u2014 no matter what you\u2019re talking about.\r\n\r\n\u23f0 Set Boundaries with Do Not Disturb\r\n\r\nNeed some uninterrupted me-time? Burner's Do Not Disturb feature allows you to establish quiet hours or specific times when you don't want to be bothered by calls and text messages. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Burn Your Phone Number When You Don't Need It\r\n\r\nWhen you no longer need your second phone number, simply burn it with a single tap. Any connections and text messages associated with that second number are permanently deleted, leaving no trace behind. Talk about powerful privacy.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udce9 Auto-Replies for Effortless Communication\r\n\r\nBurner offers auto-reply functionality, allowing you to set up automatic responses to incoming messages. Stay connected and communicate effortlessly, even when you're unable to respond immediately.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcde Voicemails and Enhanced Communication Features\r\n\r\nNever miss an important message on your second phone number with our voicemail functionality, ensuring that callers can leave you messages when you're unavailable. Other features (some premium) include AI voicemail sorting to sift through the noise, improved call quality, and video messages for fun, private video chats.\r\n\r\nBEST IN CLASS\r\n\r\nWe\u2019re not here to brag (okay, maybe a little), but Burner has been featured as a TIME Magazine Top 50 App and has garnered recognition from The New York Times, WIRED, TechCrunch, Engadget, and more.\r\n\r\nTHE FINE PRINT\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://burnerapp.com/privacy\r\nTerms of Use: https://burnerapp.com/terms-of-service\r\n\r\nIMPORTANT: Phone calls use cell phone minutes. Burners are free for a trial period only \u2014 please review our pricing before purchasing. Area code availability varies. May not work with SMS shortcode services. Not for 911 emergency services. Works in the US and Canada only. Not available in Puerto Rico.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Take Control of Your Phone Number Privacy with \ud83d\udd25Burner \ud83d\udd25<br><br>Welcome to Burner, the ultimate virtual solution for safeguarding your privacy in a connected world. Burner empowers you to protect your personal information, maintain boundaries, and communicate on your terms. <br><br>1\ufe0f\u20e3Sign up for Burner and select an area code to create your private number<br>2\ufe0f\u20e3Enjoy sending and receiving unlimited SMS messages and calls (all you need is a Wi-Fi connection or mobile data)<br>3\ufe0f\u20e3Burn your number whenever you want and get a new anonymous line<br><br>\ud83d\udd12 Keep Your Real Number Under Wraps<br><br>Tired of sharing your personal phone number with everyone but don\u2019t want to get a second SIM card or eSIM just for private communications? Burner lets you create temporary, disposable phone numbers for any occasion.<br><br>\ud83c\udf10Spam-Free, Private Connections<br><br>Say goodbye to annoying callers and intrusive messages. Our award-winning spam-blocking feature means you can connect confidently without the fear of spam calls and texts.<br><br>\ud83d\ude43 Simplify Your Busy Life<br><br>Burner provides essential tools, like private SMS text messages, and organizational features, like color-coded inboxes, to effortlessly manage your communications \u2014 no matter what you\u2019re talking about.<br><br>\u23f0 Set Boundaries with Do Not Disturb<br><br>Need some uninterrupted me-time? Burner&#39;s Do Not Disturb feature allows you to establish quiet hours or specific times when you don&#39;t want to be bothered by calls and text messages. <br><br>\ud83d\udd25 Burn Your Phone Number When You Don&#39;t Need It<br><br>When you no longer need your second phone number, simply burn it with a single tap. Any connections and text messages associated with that second number are permanently deleted, leaving no trace behind. Talk about powerful privacy.<br><br>\ud83d\udce9 Auto-Replies for Effortless Communication<br><br>Burner offers auto-reply functionality, allowing you to set up automatic responses to incoming messages. Stay connected and communicate effortlessly, even when you&#39;re unable to respond immediately.<br><br>\ud83d\udcde Voicemails and Enhanced Communication Features<br><br>Never miss an important message on your second phone number with our voicemail functionality, ensuring that callers can leave you messages when you&#39;re unavailable. Other features (some premium) include AI voicemail sorting to sift through the noise, improved call quality, and video messages for fun, private video chats.<br><br>BEST IN CLASS<br><br>We\u2019re not here to brag (okay, maybe a little), but Burner has been featured as a TIME Magazine Top 50 App and has garnered recognition from The New York Times, WIRED, TechCrunch, Engadget, and more.<br><br>THE FINE PRINT<br><br>Privacy Policy: https://burnerapp.com/privacy<br>Terms of Use: https://burnerapp.com/terms-of-service<br><br>IMPORTANT: Phone calls use cell phone minutes. Burners are free for a trial period only \u2014 please review our pricing before purchasing. Area code availability varies. May not work with SMS shortcode services. Not for 911 emergency services. Works in the US and Canada only. Not available in Puerto Rico.",
